<title>USA: Ambac qualified two issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>Ambac qualified two issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ambac Assurance Corp. said on Monday it qualified for municipal bond insurance the following two issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Burlington, Iowa, $4.5 million corporate purpose GOs.</p>
<p>--Mount Lebanon, Pa., $6.6 million GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
